  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "text": "Myntra has started using AI-generated product images for clothing listings, and it’s becoming difficult to trust what the actual product looks like. The Myntra listing used heavily AI-edited photos that changed the appearance of the garment.",
      "source": "Play Store",
      "source_id": "c17ee023-5e35-4e55-8623-e51ea357deef",
      "date": "2026-08-15",
      "confidence": 0.94,
      "tags": [
        "product_image_inaccuracy"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    },
    {
      "text": "On Myntra, the photos of the clothes are so edited that the colour of the clothes shown on the pictures are wayyy different that the clothes’ actual colour. In the photos, the clothes look like they are of good quality, but when you receive them...",
      "source": "YouTube",
      "source_id": "UgxL5BMpnYSYLdDJik94AaABAg",
      "date": "2023-11-20",
      "confidence": 0.92,
      "tags": [
        "color_mismatch"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    },
    {
      "text": "The product details on the app specified a 'regular fit,' but I received a 'relaxed fit' in a completely different color. Now, when I try to return this incorrect item, the app is charging me a ₹50 return processing fee.",
      "source": "Play Store",
      "source_id": "205ad5f3-2687-47ba-a505-f60bd3b42e3b",
      "date": "2026-08-13",
      "confidence": 0.91,
      "tags": [
        "inaccurate_product_specs"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    },
    {
      "text": "I have ordered a denim skirt in navy blue color with a 32 waist size, which was tight on me, so I have exchanged it for a 34 size but received it in a different blue shade. But I want the original navy blue shade.",
      "source": "PissedConsumer",
      "source_id": "pc_p12_2412503",
      "date": "2026-08-17",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "tags": [
        "sizing_uncertainty"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    },
    {
      "text": "I got a watch without a warranty card and I got a shirt which is not as per the measurements shown on the product page. I wrote a review and both of them are rejected with the same reason - Contains Service related feedback.",
      "source": "Play Store",
      "source_id": "88388fd0-7c02-4035-a8b0-fe7729e4bb8e",
      "date": "2026-08-11",
      "confidence": 0.88,
      "tags": [
        "size_chart_gap"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    }
  ],
